1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 4=

15
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:01,600
(Wang Feng, Heavenly Sword Sect Master)
Activate the formation.

16
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:36,719
This Dao Bone was left behind

17
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:39,159
by the previous sect master
of the Heavenly Sword Sect when he fell.

18
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,920
Our sect's spirit vein

19
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:43,799
nourished it for 81 years
before it was finally restored.

20
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:46,400
(Elder Deng, Heavenly Sword Sect)
Dao Bones are ranked

21
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,159
from lowest to highest.

22
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:49,480
Low-grade Dao Bone.

23
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,599
Mid-grade Dao Bone.

24
00:01:50,799 --> 00:01:51,840
High-grade Dao Bone.

25
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,120
Divine-grade Dao Bone.

26
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,280
Supreme-grade Dao Bone.

27
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,519
Legend says beyond supreme

28
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,680
lies the sacred-grade Dao Bone.

29
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,480
However,

30
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,879
even a divine-grade Dao Bone

31
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,079
may not appear once in a thousand years.

32
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:06,280
As for supreme and sacred grades,

33
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,599
they are simply

34
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:09,719
the stuff of legend.

35
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:11,840
For cultivators over thrity,

36
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,360
their innate foundation
is already set.

37
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,759
So don't bother trying.

38
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,960
It would be useless to you.

39
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,879
That divine-grade Dao Bone

40
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,479
will be mine today.

41
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,063
(Jiang Cheng,
Holy Son of Nanyuan Kingdom)

42
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,520
We won't be outdone.

43
00:02:27,542 --> 00:02:29,828
(Liang Wu, Tianwu Sect
Chief Disciple)

44
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:37,159
Neither will we.

45
00:02:40,279 --> 00:02:42,672
(Qin Lan, Qingyun Sect Chief Disciple)

46
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,719
Nor will I yield.

47
00:02:50,036 --> 00:02:51,490
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

48
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,080
The Holy Son and Holy Maiden
from the two kingdoms are here.

49
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,960
So are the top young disciples

50
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,879
(Xiao Wu, Heavenly Sword Sect Disciple)
from the Qingyun and Tianwu Sects.

51
00:02:58,199 --> 00:02:59,280
Why has our sect sent no one?

52
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,039
(Da Wu, Heavenly Sword Sect Disciple)
Remember Zhao Feiyang?

53
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,919
He was our chief disciple
three years ago.

54
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,199
But his cultivation is ruined now.

55
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,599
Otherwise, outsiders
wouldn't get a chance.

56
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:10,159
The Sect Master had no choice
but to offer it.

57
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,319
Whichever faction wins this Dao Bone

58
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:15,120
will owe our sect a favor.

59
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,680
But our Heavenly Sword Sect

60
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:18,280
still has someone else.

61
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,360
Back then,

62
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,759
he was second only to Zhao Feiyang.

63
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,960
You mean Lin Xuan?

64
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:25,759
He spent a year training
in Myriad Beasts Valley

65
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,199
and still hasn't returned.

66
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,199
I'm afraid...

67
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,800
I hope I'm not too late.

68
00:03:35,256 --> 00:03:36,876
(Lin Xuan, Heavenly Sword Sect
Chief Disciple)

69
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:11,400
Whoever wins this Dao Bone today

70
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,400
will owe the Heavenly Sword Sect
a favor.

71
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,360
You must swear upon your Dao heart

72
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,920
that wherever you go,

73
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,160
you will stand with our sect.

74
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,759
We swear upon our Dao hearts.

75
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:06,000
What belongs to our sect

76
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:08,319
should remain with our sect.

77
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:41,480
Oh, no.

78
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,639
Senior Brother Lin is still outmatched.

79
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,639
That's because the Tianwu
and Qingyun Sects

80
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,000
have always stood together.

81
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:48,040
Two against one.

82
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,439
It's no surprise Senior Brother Lin lost.

83
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,639
Is there no one here who can fight?

84
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,079
Are you okay?

85
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:36,639
What...?

86
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,439
You... How...

87
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:38,399
I'm sorry.

88
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:39,240
Sect Master.

89
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:41,399
Elder.

90
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,759
You did your best.

91
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:43,959
Keep training.

92
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:45,360
Yes.

93
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,759
Congratulations, Holy Maiden.

94
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,040
You've won the divine-grade Dao Bone.

95
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,639
We'll see who's stronger

96
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:51,879
at the Dao Tournament.

97
00:06:59,000 --> 00:06:59,720
Not bad at all.

98
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,000
That's my wife.

99
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,759
Congratulations, Qiushui.

100
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:03,399
Jiang Cheng.

101
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:04,199
Shut up.

102
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,680
I'm not your wife.

103
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,759
There are two great empires
in the Southern Domain.

104
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,399
You're a Holy Maiden.
I'm a Holy Son.

105
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:11,639
Sooner or later,
we'll make a perfect match.

106
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:12,399
Sorry.

107
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,759
I already have a fiancé.

108
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,399
I know about him.

109
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,079
He's washed up.

110
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,040
Qiushui.

111
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:27,560
You still plan to marry him?

112
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,399
He's not washed up.

113
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,120
Then what is he?

114
00:08:20,010 --> 00:08:21,997
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

115
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:22,800
Zhao Feiyang.

116
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,320
I've kept this high-grade Dao Bone

117
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,039
for you for three years.

118
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,919
You were born gifted

119
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,440
and were once the Heavenly Sword Sect's
chief disciple.

120
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,799
Today, I'm returning it to you.

121
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,080
With this Dao Bone,

122
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,799
from this day forward,

123
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,679
no one will ever look down on you.

124
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,200
Qiushui.

125
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,080
You truly are kindhearted.

126
00:08:51,559 --> 00:08:52,080
Oh no.

127
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:54,639
Zhao Feiyang is about
to make a comeback.

128
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,960
What if he takes revenge on us?

129
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,360
(Darn.)

130
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,879
(Will Zhao Feiyang)

131
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,759
(outshine me again?)

132
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,360
(I can't accept this.)

133
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,799
Zhao Feiyang.

134
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,639
Seize this opportunity.

135
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:09,639
Absorb the Dao Bone.

136
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:12,320
I will help you stabilize it.

137
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:13,639
Zhao Feiyang.

138
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,360
What are you waiting for?

139
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:17,919
(Zhao Feiyang.)

140
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,879
(You can keep acting tough,)

141
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:21,399
(but I know)

142
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,159
(right now,)

143
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:24,720
(you're deeply moved.)

144
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,200
The trash you didn't want?

145
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,960
I don't need it.

146
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,279
What...

147
00:09:56,327 --> 00:09:58,953
♪My blood runs hot♪

148
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:02,400
♪I never lose a fight♪

149
00:10:02,633 --> 00:10:05,740
♪I rise against the odds♪

150
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:09,110
♪Who dares stand against me♪

151
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:12,257
♪One slash, all foes fade♪

152
00:10:12,284 --> 00:10:15,563
♪No one can hold me down♪

153
00:10:15,591 --> 00:10:18,450
♪On the road to my dreams♪

154
00:10:18,577 --> 00:10:21,597
♪I fear nothing♪

155
00:10:21,664 --> 00:10:27,400
♪The stars shine bright,
lighting my way♪

156
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:33,873
♪With lofty dreams,
I'll shatter the heavens♪

157
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:41,288
♪My name will live in history,
praised for ages to come♪

158
00:10:41,779 --> 00:10:47,320
♪My legend will spread,
and all will bow♪

159
00:10:48,289 --> 00:10:51,200
♪My blood runs hot♪

160
00:10:51,342 --> 00:10:54,554
♪I never lose a fight♪

161
00:10:54,634 --> 00:10:57,702
♪I rise against the odds♪

162
00:10:57,727 --> 00:11:01,628
♪Who dares stand against me♪

163
00:11:01,662 --> 00:11:03,475
♪I rise against the odds♪

164
00:11:03,495 --> 00:11:05,115
♪My fate begins anew♪

165
00:11:05,129 --> 00:11:06,614
♪A legend for the ages♪

166
00:11:06,648 --> 00:11:08,714
♪I write my life anew♪

167
00:11:30,923 --> 00:11:33,093
♪I write my life anew♪
